#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:4
msgid "UDF configuration API"
msgstr "UDF 配置 API"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:6
msgid ""
"For configuration choices and engine support, see :ref:`udf_configuration`. "
"This reference lists decorator signatures, parameter defaults, and errors."
msgstr "配置项的选择和执行引擎支持情况见 :ref:`udf_configuration`。本页列出装饰器签名、参数默认值和异常。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:1 of
msgid "Select the execution engine and resources for a UDF."
msgstr "为 UDF 设置执行引擎和资源。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount maxframe.udf.with_image_options
#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements
#: maxframe.udf.with_resources maxframe.udf.with_running_options of
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:3 of
msgid ""
"Engine name, such as ``\"DPE\"`` or ``\"MCSQL\"``. Case is ignored. If "
"omitted, follow the job's engine selection. The engine must be available and"
" support the operation."
msgstr "引擎名称，例如 ``\"DPE\"`` 或 ``\"MCSQL\"``，不区分大小写。省略时沿用作业的引擎选择。该引擎需要可用，并且支持相应操作。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:7 of
msgid ""
"Positive CPU count for each task. Omitted fields inherit "
"``options.function.default_running_options``."
msgstr "每个任务申请的 CPU 数量，必须大于 0。未设置的字段继承 ``options.function.default_running_options``。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:10 of
msgid ""
"Starting memory for each task. Integers are in GiB; strings accept units "
"such as ``\"512MiB\"`` or ``\"8GiB\"``. Omission inherits the shared "
"default."
msgstr "每个任务的起始内存。整数以 GiB 为单位，字符串支持 ``\"512MiB\"``、``\"8GiB\"`` 等带单位的形式。省略时继承共享默认值。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:13 of
msgid ""
"Upper bound for elastic-memory retries of eligible DPE CPU UDFs, in the same"
" units as ``memory``. The merged settings must contain ``memory``. Equal "
"values disable expansion; a smaller limit is invalid. ``None`` inherits a "
"shared limit. Cluster resources can cap the effective limit."
msgstr ""
"符合条件的 DPE CPU UDF 弹性重试的内存上限，单位与 ``memory`` 相同。合并后的配置必须包含 "
"``memory``。两者相等时不扩容，上限小于起始内存时配置无效。``None`` 会继承共享上限。实际上限还受到集群资源的限制。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:18 of
msgid ""
"Positive GPU-unit count for a DPE UDF. Cannot be combined with ``cpu`` or "
"``memory``."
msgstr "DPE UDF 申请的 GPU 单元数，必须大于 0，不能与 ``cpu`` 或 ``memory`` 同时设置。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:21 of
msgid ""
"GPU quota nickname, or nicknames in usage-priority order. Omission uses "
"``options.session.gu_quota_name``. A quota alone does not request a GPU."
msgstr ""
"GPU Quota 昵称，或按使用优先级排列的昵称列表。省略时使用 ``options.session.gu_quota_name``。只设置 "
"Quota 不会申请 GPU。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:24 of
msgid ""
"Specification for a Spot GU quota, such as ``\"gu.gu8tf-8x.spot\"``. "
"Requires ``gu_quota`` and cannot be combined with ``cpu`` or ``memory``. The"
" specification determines the GPU count."
msgstr ""
"Spot GU Quota 的规格，例如 ``\"gu.gu8tf-8x.spot\"``。需要同时设置 ``gu_quota``，不能与 "
"``cpu`` 或 ``memory`` 同时设置。GPU 数量由规格决定。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:28 of
msgid ""
"Additional running options. ``image_name`` delegates to "
":func:`with_image_options` to select a registered MaxCompute image."
msgstr "其他运行选项。其中 ``image_name`` 通过 :func:`with_image_options` 选择已在 MaxCompute 注册的镜像。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount maxframe.udf.with_image_options
#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements
#: maxframe.udf.with_resources maxframe.udf.with_running_options of
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:31 of
msgid "Decorator that attaches engine and resource settings to a callable."
msgstr "将引擎和资源设置附加到可调用对象上的装饰器。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount maxframe.udf.with_image_options
#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements
#: maxframe.udf.with_resources maxframe.udf.with_running_options of
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount maxframe.udf.with_image_options
#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements
#: maxframe.udf.with_resources maxframe.udf.with_running_options of
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "异常"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:34 of
msgid "If ``memory`` or ``memory_limit`` is not an integer or string."
msgstr "``memory`` 或 ``memory_limit`` 既不是整数也不是字符串时抛出。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:35 of
msgid ""
"If a numeric resource request is non-positive, ``gu_type`` has no quota,"
"     or a GPU request is combined with CPU or memory. Invalid memory sizes "
"or     limits also fail when the effective resource settings are collected."
msgstr ""
"数值资源申请不大于 0、设置了 ``gu_type`` 却没有 Quota，或 GPU 申请与 "
"CPU、内存同时设置时抛出。收集最终资源配置时，也会校验内存值和上限是否合法。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:19 maxframe.udf.with_image_options:14
#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:19 maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:23
#: maxframe.udf.with_resources:17 maxframe.udf.with_running_options:38 of
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:39 of
msgid ""
"Use one decorator for all engine and resource settings. When an outer "
"``with_running_options`` decorator specifies an engine or resource option, "
"it replaces the inner engine and entire resource dictionary; fields are not "
"merged between decorators. Missing fields then inherit "
"``options.function.default_running_options`` when the operation is built. An"
" empty decorator, or one that only sets ``image_name``, leaves the existing "
"engine and resource settings unchanged."
msgstr ""
"使用一个装饰器集中设置引擎和资源。如果外层 ``with_running_options`` "
"设置了引擎或资源参数，就会替换内层的引擎和整个资源字典，装饰器之间不会逐字段合并。缺少的字段会在构建操作时继承 "
"``options.function.default_running_options``。空装饰器或只设置 ``image_name`` "
"的装饰器，会保留已有的引擎和资源设置。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_running_options:47 of
msgid ""
"CPU and memory apply to DPE and MCSQL. Elastic memory and GPU resources "
"apply only to DPE. Resource requests do not make a Python loop parallel."
msgstr "CPU 和内存配置适用于 DPE、MCSQL。弹性内存和 GPU 资源只适用于 DPE。申请资源不会自动让 Python 循环并行执行。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:24 maxframe.udf.with_image_options:20
#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:25 maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:28
#: maxframe.udf.with_resources:22 maxframe.udf.with_running_options:51 of
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:1 of
msgid "Declare Python packages needed by a remote UDF."
msgstr "声明远程 UDF 所需的 Python 包。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:3 of
msgid ""
"Package requirements, optionally with version constraints, such as "
"``\"Pillow==10.4.0\"``. Packages must support the remote Python ABI."
msgstr "包依赖，可以包含版本限制，例如 ``\"Pillow==10.4.0\"``。包需要支持远程运行环境的 Python ABI。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:6 of
msgid "Rebuild the PythonPack environment instead of reusing a matching build."
msgstr "重新构建 PythonPack 环境，不复用已有的匹配构建。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:8 of
msgid "Prefer binary wheels over source distributions."
msgstr "优先使用二进制 wheel 包。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:10 of
msgid "Allow pre-release package versions."
msgstr "允许使用预发布版本。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:12 of
msgid ""
"Skip the wheel compatibility audit. The wheel must still be compatible with "
"the remote runtime."
msgstr "跳过 wheel 兼容性检查，但 wheel 本身仍需兼容远程运行环境。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:16 of
msgid ""
"Decorator that attaches PythonPack requirements to a callable. Repeated "
"decorators append requirement groups."
msgstr "将 PythonPack 依赖附加到可调用对象上的装饰器。多次使用装饰器会追加依赖组。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:20 of
msgid "If a requirement contains malformed shell-style quoting."
msgstr "依赖字符串中的 shell 风格引号不匹配时抛出。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_python_requirements:24 of
msgid ""
"DPE and MCSQL build or reuse the package environment before running the UDF."
" Installing a package on the client does not install it remotely."
msgstr "DPE 和 MCSQL 会在执行 UDF 前构建或复用包环境。客户端安装了某个包，不代表远程环境也已安装。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_resources:1 of
msgid "Make MaxCompute resource files available to a UDF."
msgstr "让 UDF 可以使用 MaxCompute 资源文件。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_resources:3 of
msgid ""
"Names or Resource objects for files already uploaded to MaxCompute. Resource"
" objects retain their project and schema qualification."
msgstr "已上传到 MaxCompute 的文件资源名称或 Resource 对象。传入 Resource 对象时，会保留其项目和 schema 信息。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_resources:6 of
msgid ""
"Wrap the callable in a MarkedFunction. If False, append to the callable's "
"existing ``file_resources`` attribute instead."
msgstr "是否将可调用对象包装成 MarkedFunction。为 False 时，向该对象已有的 ``file_resources`` 属性追加资源。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_resources:10 of
msgid ""
"Decorator that adds resources and returns the decorated callable. Repeated "
"decorators append resources."
msgstr "添加资源并返回包装后函数的装饰器。多次使用装饰器会追加资源。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_resources:14 of
msgid ""
"If ``use_wrapper_class=False`` and the callable has no     "
"``file_resources`` attribute."
msgstr "``use_wrapper_class=False``，且可调用对象没有 ``file_resources`` 属性时抛出。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_resources:18 of
msgid ""
"DPE and MCSQL provide the files in the function's working directory. "
"``with_resource_libraries`` is an alias of this function."
msgstr "DPE 和 MCSQL 会将这些文件放到函数的工作目录中。``with_resource_libraries`` 是该函数的别名。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:1 of
msgid "Mount an OSS path for a DPE UDF."
msgstr "为 DPE UDF 挂载 OSS 路径。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:3 of
msgid ""
"OSS URI including endpoint, bucket, and optional prefix, for example ``\"oss"
"://oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/bucket/models\"``."
msgstr ""
"OSS URI，包含 endpoint、bucket 和可选的前缀，例如 ``\"oss://oss-cn-"
"hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/bucket/models\"``。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:6 of
msgid "Local path through which the UDF reads the mounted files."
msgstr "UDF 用于读取挂载文件的本地路径。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:8 of
msgid ""
"Authentication settings. Provide ``role_arn``, or both ``access_key_id`` and"
" ``access_key_secret``. Credentials are required; the default ``None`` does "
"not provide anonymous access."
msgstr ""
"鉴权配置。需要提供 ``role_arn``，或同时提供 ``access_key_id`` 和 "
"``access_key_secret``。鉴权信息不可省略；默认值 ``None`` 不表示允许匿名访问。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:13 of
msgid "Decorator that appends a mount to the callable's mount settings."
msgstr "向可调用对象追加挂载配置的装饰器。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:16 of
msgid ""
"If either path is missing or is not a string, authentication is missing,"
"     or mounts on the same callable use different ``storage_options``."
msgstr "任一路径缺失或不是字符串、缺少鉴权信息，或同一函数的多个挂载使用不同 ``storage_options`` 时抛出。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_fs_mount:20 of
msgid ""
"This decorator requires DPE but does not select the engine automatically. "
"For several mounts on one function, use identical authentication settings."
msgstr "该装饰器需要 DPE，但不会自动选择引擎。同一个函数挂载多个路径时，需要使用相同的鉴权配置。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:1 of
msgid "Configure public, internal, or VPC access for a DPE UDF."
msgstr "为 DPE UDF 配置公网、内网或 VPC 访问。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:3 of
msgid ""
"Name of a MaxCompute network link for a VPC service. Create it using the "
"`Access VPC solution <https://help.aliyun.com/zh/maxcompute/user-guide"
"/access-vpc-solution-direct-connection>`_."
msgstr ""
"访问 VPC 服务的 MaxCompute network link 名称。创建方法见 `访问 VPC 方案 "
"<https://help.aliyun.com/zh/maxcompute/user-guide/access-vpc-solution-"
"direct-connection>`_。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:6 of
msgid ""
"Public IP addresses or domains. These must be approved for the project "
"through a service ticket before use."
msgstr "公网 IP 地址或域名。使用前，需要提交工单，为当前项目开通对应白名单。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:9 of
msgid ""
"Alibaba Cloud internal IP addresses or domains, such as an OSS internal "
"endpoint. Obtain each endpoint from the corresponding service's docs."
msgstr "阿里云内网 IP 地址或域名，例如 OSS 内网 endpoint。具体地址应从对应服务的文档中获取。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:13 of
msgid "Decorator that attaches network settings to a callable."
msgstr "将网络配置附加到可调用对象上的装饰器。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:16 of
msgid "If repeated decorators request different VPC network links."
msgstr "多次使用装饰器时指定了不同的 VPC network link，会抛出此异常。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_network_options:20 of
msgid ""
"Public whitelists are combined, as are internal whitelists, across "
"decorators and DPE shared settings. Only one VPC link is allowed per "
"function. The decorator does not select DPE automatically."
msgstr ""
"多个装饰器与 DPE 共享配置中的公网白名单会合并，内网白名单也会分别合并。每个函数只能使用一个 VPC network link。该装饰器不会自动选择"
" DPE。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_image_options:1 of
msgid "Select a registered custom image for a DPE UDF."
msgstr "为 DPE UDF 选择已注册的自定义镜像。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_image_options:3 of
msgid ""
"Name of an image already registered in MaxCompute. Required despite the "
"``None`` default in the signature."
msgstr "已在 MaxCompute 注册的镜像名称。签名中的默认值虽然为 ``None``，实际使用时仍必须提供。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_image_options:6 of
msgid "Additional image options passed to the runtime."
msgstr "传给运行环境的其他镜像选项。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_image_options:8 of
msgid "Decorator that attaches image settings to a callable."
msgstr "将镜像配置附加到可调用对象上的装饰器。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_image_options:11 of
msgid "If ``image_name`` is empty or the callable already has image settings."
msgstr "``image_name`` 为空，或该函数已经有镜像配置时抛出。"

#: maxframe.udf.with_image_options:15 of
msgid ""
"This decorator does not select DPE automatically. Use "
":func:`with_running_options` to select it. The function-level image replaces"
" ``options.session.image_name``."
msgstr ""
"该装饰器不会自动选择 DPE，需要通过 :func:`with_running_options` 指定引擎。函数级镜像配置会覆盖 "
"``options.session.image_name``。"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:28
msgid "Shared options"
msgstr "共享配置"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:30
msgid ""
"Set these options before creating the session and relevant expressions. See "
":ref:`udf_config_precedence` for how decorators interact with defaults."
msgstr "在创建会话和相关表达式前设置这些选项。装饰器与默认值之间的覆盖规则见 :ref:`udf_config_precedence`。"

