msgstr "``{\"cpu\": 1, \"memory\": \"4GiB\", \"gpu\": 0}``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:49
msgid ""
"CPU, starting memory, and GPU defaults for each function task. An optional "
"``memory_limit`` sets the DPE CPU UDF elastic-memory limit."
msgstr "每个函数任务默认使用的 CPU、起始内存和 GPU。还可以用 ``memory_limit`` 设置 DPE CPU UDF 的弹性内存上限。"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:51
msgid "``options.function.allowed_max_memory_cpu_ratio``"
msgstr "``options.function.allowed_max_memory_cpu_ratio``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:52
msgid "Positive ``int`` up to 12"
msgstr "不大于 12 的正整数 ``int``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:53
msgid "``12``"
msgstr "``12``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:54
msgid ""
"Maximum GiB of memory per CPU. MaxFrame increases the CPU request when a "
"task exceeds this ratio."
msgstr "每个 CPU 最多可配多少 GiB 内存。任务申请的内存超过这个比例时，MaxFrame 会增加 CPU 数量。"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:56
msgid "``options.session.gu_quota_name``"
msgstr "``options.session.gu_quota_name``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:57 ../../source/reference/udf.rst:61
msgid "``str`` or ``None``"
msgstr "``str`` 或 ``None``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:58 ../../source/reference/udf.rst:62
msgid "``None``"
msgstr "``None``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:59
msgid "Default GPU quota nickname. Setting it does not request a GPU."
msgstr "默认使用的 GPU Quota 别名。只设置 Quota 不会申请 GPU，还需要指定 GPU 数量。"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:60
msgid "``options.session.image_name``"
msgstr "``options.session.image_name``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:63
msgid ""
"Default registered MaxCompute image for DPE function tasks. Does not select "
"DPE automatically."
msgstr "DPE 函数任务默认使用的 MaxCompute 注册镜像。设置该项不会自动选择 DPE。"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:65
msgid "``options.dpe.settings[\"substep.public_network_whitelist\"]``"
msgstr "``options.dpe.settings[\"substep.public_network_whitelist\"]``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:66 ../../source/reference/udf.rst:71
msgid "``list[str]``"
msgstr "``list[str]``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:67 ../../source/reference/udf.rst:72
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "未设置"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:68
msgid ""
"Public IP addresses or domains requested for DPE function tasks. Submit a "
"service ticket before use to have the entries added to the whitelist."
msgstr "DPE 任务需要访问的公网 IP 地址或域名。使用前需要提交工单，将这些地址加入白名单。"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:70
msgid "``options.dpe.settings[\"substep.internal_network_whitelist\"]``"
msgstr "``options.dpe.settings[\"substep.internal_network_whitelist\"]``"

#: ../../source/reference/udf.rst:73
msgid ""
"Alibaba Cloud internal IP addresses or domains requested for DPE function "
"tasks."
msgstr "DPE 任务需要访问的阿里云内网 IP 地址或域名。"
